OL,3,GNEWSAThird man in court charged with
OL,4,Ashooting murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA third man has appeared in court
OL,7,Fcharged with murdering a man in a
OL,8,Fshooting seven years ago.
OL,10,FHemewand Ali Hussain was found dead in
OL,11,Fa derelict house on Charterhouse
OL,12,FStreet, Hartlepool, on 14 September
OL,13,F2019.
OL,15,FDani Kadiu, 35, of Kilburn Road,
OL,16,FLondon, appeared at Teesside Crown
OL,17,FCourt via video link. He was further
OL,18,Fremanded for a plea and trial
OL,19,Fpreparation hearing next month.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
